      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SERGENTMAJOR JUJON (1) finished seventh last start over 1780m at this track, beaten 100 metres, after a good second at this track the run prior. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Won't find this any harder and he can finish a lot closer this time. COLT KELLY (2) faces the starter for the first time. Gelding by Colt Thirty One and hails from the Ben Battle stable. Has the benefit of a good draw. Was not far away in a recent trial. Capable of taking this out. ARKANSAURUS (4) was unplaced two starts ago then things went wrong last start when she copped a check and broke, finishing 25 metres away in seventh over 1780m at this track. Can't make any mistakes against this field but she is right in the mix. FORGETTABLE (3) is worth another chance after a last-start tenth over 1740m at Riverina Paceway two months ago.",
